  "description": "How to catch a knight? Impersonate a princess! Lilith the Demon Queen longs to meet a knight like the ones she reads about in books. In order to lure one to her castle, she kidnaps a princess and waits. Much to her delight, the knight who shows up is exactly as she pictured him! She decides to disguise herself as the princess to capture his heart...\n\n(Source: Manta)",
